self.KB_CONTENT["card:779447"]={"id":"card:779447","ty":"card","sourceId":"779447","title":"『委外進貨單建立作業(IDL)』中的『驗退DIE數量 (TI051)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"進貨單","keywords":["進貨單","大於","等於"],"y":"other","answer":"* 此欄位必須大於等於零。* 驗退DIE數量不可大於進貨DIE數量。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779771"]={"id":"card:779771","ty":"card","sourceId":"779771","title":"『批次計劃清除作業』的作業目的為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"計劃","keywords":["計劃","清除"],"y":"explain","answer":"將已無作業計劃參考價值的批次計劃檔案清除，以節省檔案空間及作業效率。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[779771,778794],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:780010"]={"id":"card:780010","ty":"card","sourceId":"780010","title":"『在製材料明細表(IDL)』中的『選擇品號 (C 20)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","品號","材料"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可勾選是否區間選擇。可自行選擇離散或區間。* 可點選(icon)或[F2]品號資料查詢(INVMB-01)，若空白表全部。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:779937"]={"id":"card:779937","ty":"card","sourceId":"779937","title":"『委外進貨單建立作業(IDL)』中的『不良品DIE數 (TI555)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"進貨單","keywords":["進貨單","大於","等於"],"y":"other","answer":"* 數量需大於等於零。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
